Capability sentinel for the cli-exit-behavior probe (AtlasCLIExitBehaviorProbe).

This file carries no schema/migration surface. It exists so the offline probe
runner invokes the CLI exit/error-behavior matrix once, comparing ptah-compat
success/failure paths against the Atlas drop-in exit contract and pinning that
the main `ptah` binary keeps rejecting the removed `atlas` namespace
(stokaro/ptah#850).
